1790:   /**
1791:    * The optional, explicit "break this down for me" step ahead of research: calls the
1792:    * model once (via `SuggestSearchQueriesInteractor`) to turn a broad topic into several
1793:    * sharper search queries, shown as additional tappable suggestions in the preflight.
1794:    * A distinct AI call from the actual web search — never implies browsing happened.
