 60: - `ui/useControllerState.ts` — subscribes the controller to React state.
 61: - `ui/griot/theme.ts` — `resolveGriotTheme(mode, accent)`: 5 accents × dark/light, HUD-toned palette (`panelStrong`, `line`, `accentSoft`, mono font selection). No reduced-motion handling anywhere yet.
